      "html": "<p>This is a plain reference for how often each regular UK check is <strong>usually</strong> done, by sector, with the regulator named.</p><p>Where the law fixes a period, we say so. Where your risk assessment sets it, which is most of them, we say that instead of inventing a number. Check the named regulator's current guidance before you set a schedule.</p>"
